`HeaderTitleBase` derives its props with `React.ComponentProps<typeof HeaderTitleComponent>`. `./HeaderTitle` already exports its own props type (`export type {HeaderProps}`), so deriving it couples this barrel to the component's implementation and breaks if props are renamed. Import the exported type instead.

```tsx
import HeaderTitleComponent from './HeaderTitle';
import type {HeaderProps} from './HeaderTitle';

function HeaderTitleBase(props: HeaderProps) {
    return <HeaderTitleComponent {...props} />;
}
```

`WorkspaceCompanyCardsTableHeaderButtonsWithBulkActionsProps` derives the parent props via `React.ComponentProps<typeof WorkspaceCompanyCardsTableHeaderButtons>`. Deriving the type with `ComponentProps` couples this caller to the component's implementation and breaks when props are renamed, instead of relying on its public contract.

Export `WorkspaceCompanyCardsTableHeaderButtonsProps` from `WorkspaceCompanyCardsTableHeaderButtons.tsx` and import it here:

```tsx
import WorkspaceCompanyCardsTableHeaderButtons, {type WorkspaceCompanyCardsTableHeaderButtonsProps} from './WorkspaceCompanyCardsTableHeaderButtons';

type WorkspaceCompanyCardsTableHeaderButtonsWithBulkActionsProps = Omit<WorkspaceCompanyCardsTableHeaderButtonsProps, 'bulkActionsButton'> & {
    // ...
};
```

`icon: React.ComponentProps<typeof Icon>['src']` derives `Icon`'s prop type via `ComponentProps`. `Icon` already exports its own props type (`IconProps`), so deriving it couples this code to `Icon`'s implementation and bypasses the intended public contract.

Import and use the exported type instead:

```tsx
import type {IconProps} from '@components/Icon';

type RightSideContextProps = {
    label: string;
    icon: IconProps['src'];
};
```

`ButtonBase` derives its props with `React.ComponentProps<typeof ButtonComponent>`. `./Button` is typed with `ButtonProps`, which is explicitly exported from `./types` — deriving the type via `ComponentProps` couples this wrapper to `Button`'s implementation and bypasses the intended public contract.

Import the exported type instead:

```tsx
import type {ButtonProps} from './types';

function ButtonBase(props: ButtonProps) {
    return <ButtonComponent {...props} />;
}
```
